  "ruleText": "Plc 1204.09 Challenging a Denial of Initial Licensure. An applicant who wishes to challenge the denial of an application for initial licensure shall do so as provided in Plc 304.10.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1200) #13704, eff 8-1-23",
